<task id="200" project="customer-provisioning-orchestration-r1">
  <metadata>
    <title>Implement H4SharedKvSecretsPopulationHandler: seed shared KV from source Azure services via SDK-native extraction (F19 automation)</title>
    <phase>H-Prime — Absorb F19/F20 first-live findings into handler catalog</phase>
    <gate>blocked</gate>
    <status>not-started</status>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Task tags include 'l2-controlplane','job-handler','auth','azure-deployment'; introduces a NEW handler primitive (source-extraction pattern for shared-tier KV); modifies task 084's shipped canonical manifest schema + generator (additive but multi-file); .cs implementation on all 4 L2 projects (`.Core` handler + seams, `.Worker` DI, `.Tests` unit tests, `.Core` DI catalog); auth-sensitive (writes 6+ secrets that gate BFF startup); any bug produces silent BFF fail-fast at boot (F20 pattern).</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>opus</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Per project CLAUDE.md §Model tier defaults: Opus for Phase H canonical secret-catalog manifest generator + high-blast-radius extensions. H4-shared introduces the source-extraction primitive that Model 2 Dedicated will also consume; getting the schema right the first time avoids Model-2 churn. Also modifies task 084's shipped generator (delicate — must preserve determinism + all 4 fan-outs).</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>xhigh</effort>
    <parallel-group>none</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>false</parallel-safe>
    <parallel-reason>Modifies task 084 shipped manifest + generator. Depends on task 084 landed 2026-08-17 (`70abd9992`). Blocks task 201 (H4b) — H4b's KV-refs resolve to secrets H4-shared seeds. Serial: 084 (done) → 200 (this task) → 201.</parallel-reason>
    <deps>036, 044, 084</deps>
